ss="navbar-menu-item" href="../../zh-cn/html_node">中文; 汉语; 华语</a></li><li><a class="navbar-menu-item" href="https://translate.codeberg.org/projects/guix/documentation-cookbook/">⊕</a></li></ul></div></li></ul></nav><a class="navbar-menu-btn" href="../.."></a></header>
<div class="section" id="g_t_0417_0430_043f_0443_0441_043a-Guix-_043d_0430-_0441_0435_0440_0432_0435_0440_0435-Linode">
<div class="header">
<p>
Next: <a href="Zapusk-Guix-na-servere-Kimsufi.html" accesskey="n" rel="next">Запуск Guix на сервере Kimsufi</a>, Previous: <a href="Nastroika-okonnogo-menedzhera.html" accesskey="p" rel="prev">Настройка оконного менеджера</a>, Up: <a href="Nastroika-sistemy.html" accesskey="u" rel="up">Настройка системы</a> &nbsp; [<a href="index.html#SEC_Contents" title="Table of contents" rel="contents">Contents</a>][<a href="Terminy-i-ukazateli.html" title="Index" rel="index">Index</a>]</p>
